exports[`renderEmail > matches snapshots 2`] = `
"View in browser: https://maya.example/news/autumn

MAYA YOGA

AUTUMN SCHEDULE

Join us this week or see the studio (https://maya.example/studio)

- Mon 7am
- Wed 6pm

[Image: Studio]
https://maya.example/classes

Book a class: https://maya.example/book

----------------------------------------

"Life changing."
-- Sam, Student

Left column

Right: https://maya.example/right

Instagram: https://instagram.com/maya
Email: mailto:hi@maya.example

--
Sent by Maya Yoga
Unsubscribe: https://maya.example/unsubscribe?t=abc
"
`;

